swccg-gemp
==========

This project is an independent GEMP host for Star Wars CCG.
It is not an official Players Committee service and is not
affiliated with Lucasfilm Ltd. or Disney.

The software is based on GEMP-SWCCG, originally published
under the MIT License. Copyright (c) 2018 Troy Biesterfeld
and subsequent contributors.

GEMP itself grew out of earlier GEMP work for the Lord of
the Rings TCG. Thanks to everyone who designed, coded,
tested, and operated LOTR GEMP and SWCCG GEMP over the
years, including Players Committee volunteers who implemented
cards and kept the public table running.

Star Wars CCG names, card text, and related marks belong to
their owners. This repository provides game-server software,
not a license to that intellectual property.

